flowchart LR
    U[User: hands busy] -->|photo / webcam| API[FastAPI backend]
    U -->|voice command| API
    API -->|audio| TR[Transcriber adapter]
    TR -->|transcript| AG[Agent loop]
    API -->|image + YAML spec| AG
    AG -->|text prompts| SG[Segmenter adapter]
    SG -->|masks + confidence| CK[Deterministic checks]
    CK -->|verdicts| RS[Reasoner adapter: explain]
    CK -->|low confidence| RC[request_recapture: max 3]
    RC -->|re-capture + reason| U
    CK --> RP[build_report: HTML + JSON]
    RS --> RP
    RP --> U
